real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9798014Z  	-- the world TITLE BELT (step two): one champion, taken by beating the holder in a PvP bout. Pure status.
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9798071Z  	CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS boxing_title (
