real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9799296Z  	-- THE MAIN EVENT (step three): a SCHEDULED prestige bout the crowd bets on. No principal cash wager —
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9799439Z  	-- the fighters fight for the belt/legend/record; the money is the SPECTATOR pot (a CASH parimutuel).
