real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9814081Z  	-- pool); the worker deals every live entrant an independent 7-card hand and pays the top places a
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9814220Z  	-- share of the pool net of a house rake — a competitive CASH redistribution (no new emission). At
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9814360Z  	-- most one OPEN tournament at a time (poker_state.current); a new one materializes on the next entry
