real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9895098Z  	-- but it trips pg-mem's `account_id = ANY(...)` query planner in the referral path — the lock is the
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9895210Z  	-- pg-mem-compatible + codebase-idiomatic fix, the withCharacter pattern).
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9895325Z  	-- (red-team R7 DoS) the keyless broadcast routes (GET /card, /u, /v1/u) resolve a name
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9895466Z  	-- case-insensitively via lower(c.name)=lower($1); the unique index above is case-sensitive so it
