real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9956547Z  	-- grow without bound between sweeps. The three deliberately NOT indexed are bounded by construction and
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9956680Z  	-- an index on them would cost writes for nothing: oauth_states holds at most 30 MINUTES of sign-in
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9956823Z  	-- attempts, vendettas holds only feuds that are still live, gala_guests only a 4h window's guests, and
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:38:05.9956969Z  	-- event_results already has one. The retention writes are append-at-the-right-edge (at ≈ now()), which
